<title>UK: Redland year pre-tax profits lower.</title>
<headline>Redland year pre-tax profits lower.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		10.4		   vs 14.8</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 16.67		  vs 16.67</p>
<p> Pretax pre-except	259.1		  vs 273.2</p>
<p> Pretax post-except     200.9		  vs 273.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   2.37 billion	 vs 2.50  billion</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 212 and 261 million stg, before exceptionals.</p>
<p>Full company name - Redland Plc</p>
